  "grade": {
    "note": "One LIGHT line per light state. S7 copies the line for the beat into the shot prompt, after the STATE block and before style_block. light_state ids are what the continuity ledger records per shot.",
    "light_states": {
      "thana_day": "LIGHT: day in the Imlipur thana office (late morning to noon). Flat warm daylight (#F6E2B0) comes in through the front doorway as one hard-edged pale shape on the cement floor and lights the room evenly; the tube light is off; the doorway is a bright pale rectangle on the sunlit yard. Shadows are flat dusty violet-grey (#6F6A7E).",
      "thana_night": "LIGHT: night in the Imlipur thana office (evening to small hours). The one tube light on the right-hand wall is on: a flat, cold greenish-white (#E4F1EA) light; whatever it reaches is lit flat and slightly cool, cast shadows are hard deep-blue (#1B2440) shapes, the corners and the barred lockup sit in night-navy (#0F1528); the front doorway is a dark navy rectangle on the night yard.",
      "lobby_day": "LIGHT: day in the talkies lobby. Dusty warm daylight from the high windows on the left wall falls in long soft-edged, semi-transparent pale shafts (#F6E2B0) across the terrazzo; the bulb over the desk is off. Shadows are flat dusty violet-grey (#6F6A7E).",
      "lobby_night": "LIGHT: night in the talkies lobby. Only the one bare tungsten bulb hanging over Nirala's desk is lit: a warm tungsten-yellow (#F2B33D) pool on the desk and on whoever is at it, with a soft-edged cone below the bulb; the far walls, pillars, stair and ticket booth fall away in flat deep-blue (#1B2440) and night-navy (#0F1528) shapes, still readable. The high windows are dark navy.",
      "lobby_dark": "LIGHT: the lobby bulb has just been switched off. The room is flat night-navy (#0F1528); the open entrance behind us lets in a little lighter navy (#1B2440) night, so the figures read as flat dark silhouettes with one thin, hard-edged cool rim on their edges.",
      "lobby_morning": "LIGHT: clear morning in the talkies lobby, weeks later. Clean pale-gold (#F7C25A) morning light from the high windows in soft-edged semi-transparent shafts; the room looks swept and bright; the bulb is off. Shadows are flat dusty violet-grey (#6F6A7E).",
      "projection_afternoon": "LIGHT: afternoon in the projection room. Warm light from the one small high window falls in two or three soft-edged, semi-transparent shafts (#F6E2B0) with a few tiny flat dust specks; the rest of the narrow room sits in flat warm brown and dusty violet-grey (#6F6A7E) shadow shapes.",
      "crossing_day": "LIGHT: day at the level crossing. Flat warm daylight under a pale hazy sky (#E6DCC3); short hard-edged dusty violet-grey (#6F6A7E) shadows; the stall bulb and the signal lamp are off.",
      "crossing_night": "LIGHT: night at the level crossing. The bulb under the stall's tin roof makes a warm tungsten-yellow (#F2B33D) pool on the bench and the kettle, with a soft-edged cone below it; the signal lamp is a small glowing brick-red (#B3332B) light; the rails pick up thin hard highlights; everything else is flat deep-blue (#1B2440) and night-navy (#0F1528) under a night-navy sky.",
      "crossing_night_truck": "LIGHT: as crossing_night, plus the truck: its two headlights throw soft-edged, semi-transparent pale-yellow (#FFE08A) cones along the road and light whoever stands in them with a hard-edged pale band; going away, its tail-lights are two small brick-red dots.",
      "crossing_dawn": "LIGHT: dawn at the level crossing. A low band of pale gold (#F7C25A) sky over the town, the rest of the sky a pale dusty blue; long hard-edged blue-violet shadows; the stall bulb is still on but weak.",
      "godown_night": "LIGHT: night inside the godown. One bare tungsten bulb on a long wire makes a warm tungsten-yellow (#F2B33D) pool on the floor and the scale, with a soft-edged cone below it; the sack blocks rise into flat deep-blue (#1B2440) and night-navy (#0F1528) up to the roof; outside the shutter is night-navy.",
      "godown_exterior": "LIGHT: night, the godown seen from outside. The shed walls are flat night-navy (#0F1528); the open shutter mouth is a black-navy rectangle with the small warm bulb glowing deep inside; a thin warm spill of light on the ground at the shutter mouth.",
      "godown_headlights": "LIGHT: as godown_night, plus the headlights of a vehicle standing outside the shutter: two soft-edged, semi-transparent pale-yellow (#FFE08A) cones sweep in through the shutter across the floor and the sacks, and give whoever faces them a hard-edged pale band of light.",
      "lane_night": "LIGHT: about 1 a.m. to 3 a.m. in the lane. Bricks, doors and paving in flat night blue (#2C3E6B) and night-navy (#0F1528); the wall lamp above the door is lit and makes a small warm tungsten-yellow (#F2B33D) pool on the step and the lower door, with a soft-edged cone below it.",
      "lane_predawn": "LIGHT: just before dawn in the lane. The sky over the lane pales to a cool grey-blue; the wall lamp is going out (a dim small yellow dot); the bricks are flat cool blue-grey shapes.",
      "lane_morning": "LIGHT: morning in the lane. Low warm gold (#F7C25A) sunlight slants into the lane in hard-edged shapes on one wall and the paving; the rest is in flat dusty violet-grey (#6F6A7E) shadow; the wall lamp is off.",
      "court_day": "LIGHT: day in the court room. Flat, even, slightly cool daylight from the high windows, with two soft-edged semi-transparent pale shafts; shadows are flat dusty violet-grey (#6F6A7E)."
